[19.723488, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[A\u001b[2K\u001b[2K\u001b[?2026l\r\n"]
[19.723606, "o", "\u001b[1;37mExplanation:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mThe command performs an interactive rebase with autosquash and autostash onto origin/main; if that succeeds, it runs a second rebase with autostash and forces the committer date to equal the author date, also onto origin/main.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  • The command starts with \u001b[36mgit\u001b[0m which invokes the Git version‑control tool.\r\n    • It runs the \u001b[36mrebase\u001b[0m subcommand to reapply commits onto another base.\r\n      • The \u001b[36m-i\u001b[0m option opens an interactive rebase session.\r\n      • The \u001b[36m--autosquash\u001b[0m flag automatically reorders and squashes fix‑up and squash commits.\r\n      • The \u001b[36m--autostash\u001b[0m option stashes local changes before rebasing and reapplies them afterward.\r\n      • It rebases onto the \u001b[36morigin/main\u001b[0m reference, which is the main branch from the remote named origin.\r\n    • The \u001b[36m&&\u001b[0m operator runs the second command only if the first succeeds.\r\n    • The second command again starts with \u001b[36mgit\u001b[0m to invoke Git.\r\n      • It runs the \u001b[36mrebase\u001b[0m subcommand to reapply commits.\r\n        • The \u001b[36m--autostash\u001b[0m option again stashes changes before rebasing.\r\n"]
[19.723655, "o", "        • The \u001b[36m--committer-date-is-author-date\u001b[0m flag makes the committer date match the author date for the new commits.\r\n        • It rebases onto the \u001b[36morigin/main\u001b[0m same remote‑tracking branch as before.\r\n\r\n"]
[19.727025, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeltik@\u001b[1;34mandie2 \u001b[0;0m[~]$ "]
[21.211953, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\r\nexit\r\n"]
